<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's Sammi Corp 96 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's Sammi Corp 96 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>	  (in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won, both loss)		    3,283    vs 1,927</p>
<p>    Net (both loss)				45.81 vs    26.85</p>
<p>    Dividend					  none vs     none</p>
<p>    Turnover					530.78 vs   574.20</p>
<p>    Pre-tax loss				   45.81 vs    24.29</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries			9.76 (loss) vs 0.14 (gain)</p>
<p>NOTE - Sammi Corp, a foreign trading company, mostly handles sales of products and purchases of materials for its sister firm Sammi Steel Co. Sammi Corp's share capital totalled 17.87 million shares at the end of 1996.</p>
<p>-- Seoul newsroom (822) 727-5646</p>
